    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/794646d7e0b0666b6970bbbe553027ec.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.mp4?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/f93ce19584b819320186de8a071e1884.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/a7e712249ae82475e0467a93bd6f820c.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>From seed to sorcery \u2013 grow known and unique crops and discover their magical evolutions in this enchanting farming game. Cultivate different types of non-magical and magical plants on your farm, separated in the categories crops, trees, herbs and flowers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/75d3a14860234f2bf77331d495e2f9c5.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d7c88e7da8b38d5b00c5d97ca04c098b.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Breed animals beyond imagination \u2013 master the art of magical crossbreeding with 27 species, including elusive dragons. Can you breed all species?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/327c9631a603a0a7402ed3a1ebd08a88.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Embrace love's variety - discover the joy of dating characters with different backgrounds and mindsets. Help them with their personal goals and problems and learn about their own story.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/bb47d31758f311f843d59b65e3458fbc.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div>  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/514d8df51a55f8310a7299155449ce27.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Rebuilding the world \u2013 restoring magic eases your farm life in a diverse world. The magic in the world has disappeared since a magical accident in the past. It's up to you to bring it back.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/3ee6ab8e23fad27405e787edaf65e91c.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Craft your own destiny - pursue various activities from cooking to fishing to brewing magic potions. Discover a wide variety of recipes and the wide range of fish with different colors. Can you catch them all?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/91a4e38fe503825be557988c452779f5.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/e3f6ba7335f02f6e178b974f0d54caa6.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br> Diverse avatars, boundless possibilities \u2013 play as one of the 5 species and customize your character based on their style: Humans, Ki'shen, Elves, Drakys and Nereids.<br> Design your dream farm - let the decoration system shape your farm's allure. Paint your decor while decorating your farm and farmhouse. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0159b9902a311be83975bf7dee64e062.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Your new home is a farm near Dragonreath, which was known as a town full of magic and wonders. But a tragic catastrophe has changed everything.<br>Discover what happened in the past when a magical accident erased the magic from the world Hyldena. Due to the absence of magic, magical plants and creatures disappeared over time, leading to despair and starvation. The gods turned their backs on the living and vanished, while the people are trying in vain to adapt in this new world since then. <br>Maybe you can find a way to restore the magic and save everyone?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/6ecbee5478232771786ec8e05c12dbb1.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Hyldena is home to 5 humanoid species: Humans, Elves, Drakys, Nereids and Ki'shen. Dragonreath is divided into 3 areas, each led by one of the factions - the <strong>Shailyn-Order</strong>, the <strong>Sidus-Alliance</strong> and the <strong>Obsideran-Pact</strong>, where each of them are trying to restore the magic in their own way - without success.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/a7e712249ae82475e0467a93bd6f820c.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>From seed to sorcery \u2013 grow known and unique crops and discover their magical evolutions in this enchanting farming game. Cultivate different types of non-magical and magical plants on your farm, separated in the categories crops, trees, herbs and flowers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/75d3a14860234f2bf77331d495e2f9c5.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d7c88e7da8b38d5b00c5d97ca04c098b.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Breed animals beyond imagination \u2013 master the art of magical crossbreeding with 27 species, including elusive dragons. Can you breed all species?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/327c9631a603a0a7402ed3a1ebd08a88.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Embrace love's variety - discover the joy of dating characters with different backgrounds and mindsets. Help them with their personal goals and problems and learn about their own story.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/bb47d31758f311f843d59b65e3458fbc.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div>  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/514d8df51a55f8310a7299155449ce27.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Rebuilding the world \u2013 restoring magic eases your farm life in a diverse world. The magic in the world has disappeared since a magical accident in the past. It's up to you to bring it back.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/3ee6ab8e23fad27405e787edaf65e91c.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Craft your own destiny - pursue various activities from cooking to fishing to brewing magic potions. Discover a wide variety of recipes and the wide range of fish with different colors. Can you catch them all?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/91a4e38fe503825be557988c452779f5.avif?t=1726932383\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/e3f6ba7335f02f6e178b974f0d54caa6.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br> Diverse avatars, boundless possibilities \u2013 play as one of the 5 species and customize your character based on their style: Humans, Ki'shen, Elves, Drakys and Nereids.<br> Design your dream farm - let the decoration system shape your farm's allure. Paint your decor while decorating your farm and farmhouse. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0159b9902a311be83975bf7dee64e062.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Your new home is a farm near Dragonreath, which was known as a town full of magic and wonders. But a tragic catastrophe has changed everything.<br>Discover what happened in the past when a magical accident erased the magic from the world Hyldena. Due to the absence of magic, magical plants and creatures disappeared over time, leading to despair and starvation. The gods turned their backs on the living and vanished, while the people are trying in vain to adapt in this new world since then. <br>Maybe you can find a way to restore the magic and save everyone?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/6ecbee5478232771786ec8e05c12dbb1.webp?t=1726932383\" /></div> <br>Hyldena is home to 5 humanoid species: Humans, Elves, Drakys, Nereids and Ki'shen. Dragonreath is divided into 3 areas, each led by one of the factions - the <strong>Shailyn-Order</strong>, the <strong>Sidus-Alliance</strong> and the <strong>Obsideran-Pact</strong>, where each of them are trying to restore the magic in their own way - without success.",
    "short_description": "Crossbreed magical animals, evolve crops, build relationships based on choices and find love without limitations. Play as one out of 5 species and shape your own enchanted farm paradise, while mastering rune carving and magic potions brewing, and restore the magic in a damaged fantasy world.",
